GrantThai is an independent, unofficial open-source project. It is NOT
affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or officially connected to:

  - NRCT   (National Research Council of Thailand)
  - TSRI   (Thailand Science Research and Innovation)
  - any PMU (Program Management Unit), e.g. บพข., บพค., บพท.
  - NRIIS  (National Research and Innovation Information System)

"NRIIS" and any related names, logos, or trademarks are the property of
their respective owners and are used here only in a descriptive, nominative
sense (to identify the external system this tool helps a person prepare
copy/paste text for). Use of these names does not imply any endorsement,
partnership, certification, or official compatibility.

GrantThai produces a human-reviewed draft file
(`build/NRIIS_SUBMISSION.md`) intended to help a person prepare content to
copy into the NRIIS system (or an equivalent). GrantThai never submits
anything automatically. A human always makes the final decision and
performs the final submission.

